                <pb facs="1167" n="1009" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1009"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Reply of the Emperor</hi>.</head>
                <p>We are pleased to receive the letter of credence from the President, informing us
                    that the Hon. Lloyd C. Griscom has been relieved of his duties and that the
                    President, having raised the legation to the rank of an embassy, has been
                    pleased to appoint your excellency as his ambassador.</p>
                <p>It is our firm conviction that the appointment of your excellency as ambassador
                    will promote and strengthen the cordial relations that have always so happily
                    existed between the two countries.</p>
                <p>We trust that the President and his family are in the enjoyment of good
                    health.</p>
            </div>
